<title>USA: Insignia completes private placement.</title>
<headline>Insignia completes private placement.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Insignia Systems Inc said Friday it completed a private placement of 1,250,000 units consisting of 1,250,000 shares of its common stock and warrants to buy an additional 625,000 shares of common.</p>
<p>The purchase price of the units was $2.125 each, and gross proceeds were $2,650,000.</p>
<p>The warrants have a three-year term, are redeemable in certain circumstances after one year and have an exercise price of $2.125 a share.</p>
<p>Insignia, a marketer of printing equipment and print media products, said it plans to use about $900,000 of the proceeds to repay bank debt incurred to finance inventory purchases of its new SIGNright system.</p>
<p>	     ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
